    "m_Title": "Closest Projected Point on the Spherecast Line",
    "m_Content": "This calculates the distance from the fragment/interpolated point on the 3D model's triangle we're currently processing in the shader, to the line defined by the localRayOrigin & localRayDirection properties.\n\nCurrently, the line is assumed infinite in both directions, in this shader math.",
